<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Reeve returns two months after his last review. He now uses the pacer for three hours twice a day. The seating service saw him three weeks ago through a second provider: pressure mapping showed higher pressure under the left sitting bone, and his cushion was adjusted; repeat mapping after the change was even. His skin has stayed intact. He has had no symptoms of autonomic dysreflexia, and his bladder and bowel programs are working. His mood is good and he is busy with his advocacy work. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Breathing</td><td>Pacer three hours twice a day</td></tr><tr><td>Seating</td><td>Pressure mapping done; cushion adjusted for higher left ischial pressure</td></tr><tr><td>Skin</td><td>Intact</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>Good; PHQ-9 2</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

